Source: libnginx-mod-http-zstd
Section: httpd
Priority: optional
Maintainer: zstd-nginx-module CI <ci@zstd-nginx-module.local>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), build-essential, libpcre2-dev, libssl-dev, zlib1g-dev, libzstd-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://github.com/tokers/zstd-nginx-module
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/shomenkow/zstd-nginx-module
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/shomenkow/zstd-nginx-module.git

Package: libnginx-mod-http-zstd-filter
Architecture: any
Depends: nginx (>= @NGINX_VERSION_LOWER@), nginx (<< @NGINX_VERSION_UPPER@), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Zstandard compression filter module for nginx
 On-the-fly Zstandard response compression filter for nginx using libzstd's
 streaming API. Compresses outgoing HTTP response bodies when the client
 advertises support via Accept-Encoding: zstd.

Package: libnginx-mod-http-zstd-static
Architecture: any
Depends: nginx (>= @NGINX_VERSION_LOWER@), nginx (<< @NGINX_VERSION_UPPER@), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Zstandard static (precompressed sidecar) module for nginx
 Serves precompressed Zstandard sidecar files (.zst) directly from disk when
 the client advertises support via Accept-Encoding: zstd. Companion to the
 on-the-fly filter module; install only when precompressed assets are used.
